direction: down
scheduler: reveille 任务配置 / 执行记录 / 日志
inspect: task_health.py 检查最近 N 天
snapshot: audit/snapshots/ 保存快照
decide: 有失败? {
  shape: diamond
}
healthy: 结束（无故障）
incident: audit/incidents/ 写故障草稿
agent: opencode 排查修复并发送通知
scheduler -> inspect -> snapshot -> decide
decide -> healthy: 否
decide -> incident: 是
incident -> agent
